The original problem was that the second ethernet card was not showing up 
when I was trying to run netsetup.  The solution was simple, rebuild the 
kernel.  However, I was running OSF/1 v2.0 and was strangly unable to 
rebuild the kernel so I upgraded to v3.0B and the device showed up as ln1 
