Sean Reifschneider, sreifsc@sreifsc.uswc.uswest.com
Mike Jones, jonesmd@aule-tek.com
Bert Robbins, brobbins@mako.Newbridge.COM
Bruce L. Harrell, bharrell@digit.com
Ross.Stocks.INSDRS, ross.stocks@nt.com
