To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: Oversized quota files on ADVFS !!
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96075319906541


Hi,

Last tuesday we ran into a problem with vdiskquota on an Alpha 2100 with
OSF/1 3.0A. We use ADVFS for the /usr filesystem.
The /etc/fstab for /usr looks like:

usr_domain#usr  /usr   advfs rq,userquota,groupquota

