>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>


1) Move "/sbin/swapdefault" to "/sbin/swapdefault.old"

2) Dormant Xserver process are known to take up swapspace and will not 
   release the space until the system is rebooted.  Add the following
   line to your file "/usr/lib/X11/adm/Xservers".

	:0 local /usr/bin/X11/X -nice -2 -terminate

3) After the above changes are made, reboot your system.

